## ApacheCon 2000 Attendees

This is the list of registered attendees who have opted to make
their name and affiliation public.  No-one is obligated to do so,
though it *is* encouraged.

If you're a registered attendee or speaker, you can update
your personal info in our database (such as your email address,
name, or affiliation) by using the
details editing form.

